            </span><span class="p">]</span><span class="w">
        </span><span class="p">]</span><span class="w">
    </span><span class="p">}</span><span class="w">
</span><span class="p">}</span><span class="w">
</span></code></pre><h3 id='response-content-14'>Response Content</h3>
<aside class="notice">The returned data object is under 'tick' object instead of 'data' object in the top level JSON</aside>

<table><thead>
<tr>
<th>Field</th>
<th>Data Type</th>
<th>Description</th>
</tr>
</thead><tbody>
<tr>
<td>status</td>
<td>string</td>
<td>Request Processing Result  &quot;ok&quot;,&quot;error&quot;</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>ch</td>
<td>string</td>
<td>Data belonged channel，Format： market.$symbol.depth.$type</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>ts</td>
<td>long</td>
<td>Time of Respond Generation, Unit: Millisecond</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>&lt;tick&gt;</td>
<td>object</td>
<td></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>ts</td>
<td>integer</td>
<td>The UNIX timestamp in milliseconds is adjusted to Singapore time</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>version</td>
<td>integer</td>
<td>Internal data</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>bids</td>
<td>object</td>
<td>The current all bids in format [price, size]</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>asks</td>
<td>object</td>
<td>The current all asks in format [price, size]</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>&lt;/tick&gt;</td>
<td></td>
<td></td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
<h2 id='get-the-last-trade'>Get the Last Trade</h2>
<p>This endpoint retrieves the latest trade with its price, volume, and direction.</p>
<h3 id='http-request-9'>HTTP Request</h3>
<ul>
<li>GET <code>/market/trade</code></li>
</ul>
<pre class="highlight shell tab-shell"><code>curl <span class="s2">"https://api.huobi.pro/market/trade?symbol=ethusdt"</span>
</code></pre><h3 id='request-parameters-13'>Request Parameters</h3>
<table><thead>
<tr>
<th>Parameter</th>
<th>Data Type</th>
<th>Required</th>
<th>Default Value</th>
<th>Description</th>
<th>Value Range</th>
</tr>
</thead><tbody>
<tr>
<td>symbol</td>
<td>string</td>
<td>true</td>
<td>NA</td>
<td>The trading symbol to query</td>
<td>Refer to <code>GET /v1/common/symbols</code></td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>

<blockquote>
