<td>float</td>
<td>The highest price of last 24 hours (rotating 24h)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>vol</td>
<td>float</td>
<td>The trading volume in base currency of last 24 hours (rotating 24h)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
