<h2 id='get-the-total-valuation-of-platform-assets'>Get The Total Valuation of Platform Assets</h2>
<p>permission type：Read</p>

<p>API Rate Limit(NEW）：3/1s</p>

<p>Obtain the total asset valuation of the platform account according to the BTC or legal currency denominated unit.</p>
<h3 id='http-request-14'>HTTP Request</h3>
<ul>
<li>GET <code>/v2/account/valuation</code></li>
</ul>
<h3 id='query-parameters-2'>Query Parameters</h3>
<table><thead>
<tr>
<th>Parameter</th>
<th>Required</th>
<th>Data Type</th>
<th>Description</th>
<th>Value Range</th>
</tr>
</thead><tbody>
<tr>
<td>accountType</td>
<td>false</td>
<td>string</td>
<td>account type, more to see &quot;Account type data dictionary&quot;</td>
<td></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>valuationCurrency</td>
<td>false</td>
<td>string</td>
<td>If not filled, the default is BTC (only BTC supported now, and must be capitalized)</td>
<td></td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>

