</tbody></table>
<h2 id='query-withdraw-quota'>Query Withdraw Quota</h2>
<p>Parent user could query withdrawing quota for currencies</p>

<p>API Key Permission：Read<br>
Rate Limit (NEW): 20times/2s</p>
<h3 id='http-request-23'>HTTP Request</h3>
<ul>
<li>GET <code>/v2/account/withdraw/quota</code></li>
</ul>
<h3 id='request-parameters-26'>Request Parameters</h3>
