<h2 id='set-asset-transfer-permission-for-sub-users'>Set Asset Transfer Permission for Sub Users</h2>
<p>API Key Permission: Trade</p>

<p>Parent user is able to set asset transfer permission for a batch of sub users.
By default, the asset transfer from sub user’s spot account to parent user’s spot account is allowed.</p>
