<h2 id='sub-user-api-key-modification'>Sub user API key modification</h2>
<p>This endpoint is used by the parent user to modify the API key of the sub user</p>

<p>API Key Permission：Trade</p>
<h3 id='http-request-40'>HTTP Request</h3>
<ul>
<li>POST <code>/v2/sub-user/api-key-modification</code></li>
</ul>
<h3 id='request-parameters-40'>Request Parameters</h3>
<table><thead>
<tr>
<th>Parameter</th>
<th>Required</th>
<th>Data Type</th>
<th>Description</th>
<th>Default</th>
<th>Value Range</th>
</tr>
</thead><tbody>
<tr>
<td>subUid</td>
<td>true</td>
<td>long</td>
<td>sub user uid</td>
<td>NA</td>
<td></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>accessKey</td>
<td>true</td>
<td>string</td>
<td>Access key for sub user API key</td>
<td>NA</td>
<td></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>note</td>
<td>false</td>
<td>string</td>
<td>API key note for sub user API key</td>
<td>NA</td>
<td>Up to 255 characters</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>permission</td>
<td>false</td>
<td>string</td>
<td>API key permission for sub user API key</td>
<td>NA</td>
<td>Valid value: readOnly, trade; multiple inputs are allowed, separated by comma, i.e. readOnly, trade; readOnly is required permission for any API key, while trade permission is optional.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>ipAddresses</td>
<td>false</td>
<td>string</td>
<td>At most 20 IPv4/IPv6 host address(es) and/or IPv4 network address(es) can bind with one API key, separated by comma. For example: 202.106.196.115, 202.106.96.0/24. An API key not linked with an IP address but has trading or withdrawal permissions will be automatically deactivated after 90 days of inactivity.</td>
<td>NA</td>
<td></td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>

<blockquote>
<p>Response:</p>
</blockquote>
<pre class="highlight json tab-json"><code><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
    </span><span class="s2">"code"</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="mi">200</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w">
    </span><span class="s2">"data"</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
        </span><span class="s2">"note"</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s2">"tom"</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w">
        </span><span class="s2">"permission"</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s2">"trade,readOnly"</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w">
        </span><span class="s2">"ipAddresses"</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s2">"192.168.1.1"</span><span class="w">
    </span><span class="p">},</span><span class="w">
    </span><span class="s2">"ok"</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kc">true</span><span class="w">
</span><span class="p">}</span><span class="w">
</span></code></pre><h3 id='response-content-42'>Response Content</h3>
