<h2 id='error-code-5'>Error Code</h2>
<p>Below is the error code, error message and description returned by Sub user management APIs</p>

<table><thead>
<tr>
<th>Error Code</th>
<th>Error Message</th>
<th>Description</th>
</tr>
</thead><tbody>
<tr>
<td>1002</td>
<td>forbidden</td>
<td>Operation is forbidden, such as sub user creation is not allowed for current user</td>
