<td>The timestamp in milliseconds when the order was created</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>type</td>
<td>string</td>
<td>All possible order type (refer to introduction in this section)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>filled-amount</td>
<td>string</td>
<td>The amount which has been filled</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>filled-cash-amount</td>
<td>string</td>
<td>The filled total in quote currency</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>filled-fees</td>
<td>string</td>
<td>Transaction fee (Accurate fees refer to matchresults endpoint)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>source</td>
