<h2 id='get-the-balance-of-the-margin-loan-account-cross'>Get the Balance of the Margin Loan Account（Cross）</h2>
<p>API Key Permission：Read</p>

<p>This endpoint returns the balance of the margin loan account.</p>
<h3 id='http-request-76'>HTTP Request</h3>
<ul>
<li>GET <code>/v1/cross-margin/accounts/balance</code></li>
</ul>
<h3 id='request-parameters-75'>Request Parameters</h3>
<table><thead>
<tr>
<th>Field Name</th>
<th>Mandotory</th>
<th>Data Type</th>
<th>Description</th>
<th>Default Value</th>
<th>Value Range</th>
</tr>
</thead><tbody>
<tr>
<td>sub-uid</td>
<td>false</td>
<td>long</td>
<td>Sub user UID</td>
<td>If not specified, returns account balance of current logged in user</td>
<td></td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>

<blockquote>
<p>The above command returns JSON structured like this:</p>
</blockquote>
<pre class="highlight json tab-json"><code><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
    </span><span class="s2">"status"</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="s2">"ok"</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w">
    </span><span class="s2">"data"</span><span class="p">:{</span><span class="w">
        </span><span class="s2">"id"</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="mi">18264</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w">
        </span><span class="s2">"type"</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="s2">"cross-margin"</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w">
        </span><span class="s2">"state"</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="s2">"working"</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w">
        </span><span class="s2">"risk-rate"</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="s2">"1000"</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w">
        </span><span class="s2">"acct-balance-sum"</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="s2">"12312.123123"</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w">
        </span><span class="s2">"debt-balance-sum"</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="s2">"1231.2123123"</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w">
        </span><span class="s2">"list"</span><span class="p">:[</span><span class="w">
            </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
