<h2 id='repayment-record-reference'>Repayment Record Reference</h2>
<p>API Key Permission: Read</p>

<p>Frequency Limit: 2/s</p>

<p>Available Accounts: Main and Sub-Accounts</p>

<p>Sort by &quot;repayTime&quot; </p>
<h3 id='http-request-77'>HTTP Request</h3>
<ul>
<li>GET <code>/v2/account/repayment</code></li>
</ul>
<h3 id='request-parameters-76'>Request Parameters</h3>
<table><thead>
<tr>
